{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_39882","headline":"经故翰林杨左丞池亭 · 徐夤","name":"经故翰林杨左丞池亭","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"八角红亭荫绿池，一朝青草盖遗基。\n蔷薇藤老开花浅，翡翠巢空落羽奇。\n春榜几深门下客，乐章多取集中诗。\n平生德义人间诵，身後何劳更立碑。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"徐夤","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_39882.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_39882","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}